  "contract": {
    "sample": "Five historical external-source pixels over explicit opaque fallback; UI-thread recording/toImageBitmap, standalone bitmap CPU readback on worker, UI callback, one request in flight, explicit sample times. Not compositor/current-frame luma.",
    "consumerIsolation": "Sampler graphicsLayer keeps consumer invalidation from re-recording a shared sibling source indefinitely.",
    "retainedNotifications": "BackdropContentSignal is an explicit UI-thread notification after actual source drawing/property/native update is available. notifyBackdropDraw belongs inside the nearest independent pane-free leaf layer, before drawing modifiers. Wrapper retained by source+signal identity; epoch is not completed recording/presentation revision; wrapped sourceRevision=null. No transparent arbitrary subtree/layer-property/native detection.",
    "hysteresis": "Caller provides initial state and finite ordered thresholds. Dock uses engineering midpoints223.5/255 and153.5/255; not measured UIKit constants.",
    "production": "LocalDockBackdropAppearanceEnabled defaults false. Production MainTabs root LayerBackdrop lacks complete retained descendant source notifications. GlassHost source/scoped material epochs also require separation before general integration."
  },
